= Constantino Lazzari

Lazzari is a long-time member of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>, co-founding the party back in 1892. Aligned with the <span style=" color:#DC143C">Maximalists</span>, he leads the current alongside Serrati.

- @party_discipline_lazzari
- @party_rally
- @fiscal_policy_lazzari
- @root: Return to main

@party_discipline_lazzari
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Lazzari can leverage his position to mediate dissent within the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (communist_dissent > 0 or reformist_dissent > 0 or labour_dissent > 0 or maximalist_dissent > 0)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if (communist_dissent = 0 and reformist_dissent = 0 and maximalist_dissent = 0 and labour_dissent = 0) : The party is the most united it has been since its inception. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; communist_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5; labour_dissent -= 5; maximalist_dissent -= 5

Lazzari is able to leverage his position to quell dissent and mediate conflict between the quarreling factions.

@party_rally
title: Party Rally
subtitle: We should go rally our voters and spread our message further.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: rally

@fiscal_policy_lazzari
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: Having control of the Financial Ministry, we can adjust taxes and tariffs.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The [+ psi_name +] is not currently in government. ?][? if not finance_minister_party == psi_name : The [+ psi_name +] does not control the Financial Ministry. ?]
choose-if: psi_in_government and finance_minister_party == psi_name and advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 5; last_advisor_action = 1;
go-to: fiscal_policy